       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
       AUTHOR. LEGACY-SYSTEM.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO 'EMPLOYEE.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  EMPLOYEE-FILE.
       01  EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
           05  EMP-ID           PIC 9(6).
           05  EMP-NAME         PIC X(30).
           05  EMP-HOURLY-RATE  PIC 9(4)V99.
           05  EMP-HOURS-WORKED PIC 9(3)V99.
           05  EMP-TAX-CODE     PIC X(2).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GROSS-PAY         PIC 9(6)V99.
       01  WS-TAX-AMOUNT        PIC 9(5)V99.
       01  WS-NET-PAY           PIC 9(6)V99.
       01  WS-TAX-RATE          PIC 9V999.
       01  WS-EOF-FLAG          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
           88  END-OF-FILE      VALUE 'Y'.
       01  WS-RECORD-COUNT      PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TOTAL-GROSS       PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE ZERO.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARAGRAPH.
           PERFORM READ-EMPLOYEE.
           PERFORM CALCULATE-PAY UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
           PERFORM WRITE-TOTALS.
           STOP RUN.

       READ-EMPLOYEE.
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF-FLAG.

       CALCULATE-PAY.
           MULTIPLY EMP-HOURLY-RATE BY EMP-HOURS-WORKED
               GIVING WS-GROSS-PAY.
           MULTIPLY WS-GROSS-PAY BY WS-TAX-RATE
               GIVING WS-TAX-AMOUNT.
           SUBTRACT WS-TAX-AMOUNT FROM WS-GROSS-PAY
               GIVING WS-NET-PAY.
           ADD WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-TOTAL-GROSS.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RECORD-COUNT.

       WRITE-TOTALS.
           DISPLAY 'TOTAL RECORDS: ' WS-RECORD-COUNT.
           DISPLAY 'TOTAL GROSS:   ' WS-TOTAL-GROSS.
